`s 78(2)(b) the notice must state whether the event has occurred` MEANS
    IF `the change of name by special resolution is conditional on the occurrence of an event`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where a change of name by special resolution is conditional on the occurrence of an event, the notice given to the registrar of the change must— ... (b) state whether the event has occurred"

